---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import ServiceGrid from '../components/ServiceGrid.astro';
import GuideGrid from '../components/GuideGrid.astro';
import {shop} from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="Your neighborhood auto repair shop in Wheat Ridge, CO" description="Meet Nichols Auto Repair in Wheat Ridge, Colorado. Serving our community since 1974 with vehicle maintenance, diagnostics, brakes, and classic car care.">
 <section class="hero wrap">
  <div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow"><span class="small-star">✦</span> WHEAT RIDGE’S NEIGHBORHOOD SHOP SINCE 1974</span><h1>Quality Auto Repair<br/><em>you Can Trust.</em></h1><p>From your daily driver to the classic you’ll never part with. We’re here to help you keep it on the road—and feel good about the miles ahead.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/contact/">Let’s talk about your car <Icon/></a><a class="text-link" href="/services/">Explore our services <Icon/></a></div><div class="hero-note"><span class="little-line"></span><span>Real conversations. Clear explanations.<br/><strong>A familiar face under the hood.</strong></span></div></div>
  <div class="hero-visual"><img class="hero-photo" src="/images/workshop.jpg" alt="A technician beside a vehicle in the Nichols workshop, from our original website" width="1600" height="1200" fetchpriority="high"/><div class="photo-caption"><span>OUR KIND OF PLACE.</span><span>WHEAT RIDGE, CO ↗</span></div><div class="heritage-seal"><span>KEEPING YOU MOVING</span><strong>SINCE<br/>1974</strong><span>★ NICHOLS AUTO REPAIR ★</span></div></div>
 </section>
 <div class="trust-strip"><div class="wrap"><span>LOCAL ROOTS. LASTING RELATIONSHIPS.</span><span><Icon name="check"/> Serving our community since 1974</span><span><Icon name="check"/> Domestic & import vehicles</span><span><Icon name="check"/> Classic cars welcome</span></div></div>
 <section class="section wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE CARE. A LOT MORE MILES.</span><h2>Whatever you drive,<br/><em>it’s in skilled hands.</em></h2></div><p>Some days it’s an oil change. Some days it’s a noise you can’t quite describe. Either way, there’s a good place to start: a conversation with your mechanic.</p></div><ServiceGrid/></section>
 <section class="story-section"><div class="wrap story-grid"><div class="story-photo"><img src="/images/engine-service.jpg" alt="Hands using a socket wrench during engine service" width="1000" height="785" loading="lazy"/><span class="photo-tag">A LITTLE ELBOW GREASE. A LOT OF HEART.</span></div><div class="story-copy"><span class="eyebrow">NOT JUST A SHOP. YOUR SHOP.</span><h2>Superior Auto Service.<br/><em>For today’s roads.</em></h2><p>There’s something good about knowing who’s working on your car. And knowing you can ask a question without getting a sales pitch.</p><p>Nichols has been part of Wheat Ridge since 1974. We want every visit to feel personal: a chance to understand your vehicle, talk through your options, and make a plan together.</p><a class="text-link" href="/about/">Get to know Nichols <Icon/></a></div></div></section>
 <section class="classic-banner wrap"><div class="classic-type" aria-hidden="true">OLD SOUL.<br/><em>OPEN ROAD.</em><span>EST. 1974 — WHEAT RIDGE, COLORADO</span></div><div><span class="eyebrow">FOR THE ONES WORTH KEEPING</span><h2>Some cars are<br/><em>part of the family.</em></h2><p>Carburetors. Chrome. A story behind every mile. Let’s talk about the mechanical care your classic needs for its next chapter.</p><a class="button button-light" href="/classic-cars/">Classic car care <Icon/></a></div></section>
 <section class="section wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE KNOW-HOW FROM THE SHOP</span><h2>Good advice.<br/><em>No jargon required.</em></h2></div><div><p>Get to know your car a little better. Straightforward guides now, with real stories from our shop to come.</p><a class="text-link" href="/repair-stories/">From the shop <Icon/></a></div></div><GuideGrid/></section>
 <section class="visit-section"><div class="wrap visit-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">RIGHT HERE ON KIPLING</span><h2>Your local stop.<br/><em>Since 1974.</em></h2><p>Serving our neighbors in Wheat Ridge, Arvada, and the surrounding Denver metro area.</p><a class="text-link" href={shop.maps} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get directions <Icon/></a></div><div class="visit-card"><Icon name="pin"/><h3>Come say hello.</h3><p>{shop.street}<br/>{shop.city}</p><div class="visit-hours"><span>Monday–Friday</span><strong>8:30 am–5:30 pm</strong></div><p class="small">Call for Saturday availability.</p><a href={shop.phoneHref}>{shop.phone} <Icon name="phone"/></a></div></div></section>
</Base>
